Wrote the label file with one row for `misinformation`. HB2394 is a digital-impersonation (deepfake) civil-remedy bill that explicitly shields platforms from liability — it doesn't map to any rung's specific clause (removal mandate, labeling mandate, voluntary standards, free-speech/censorship, or banning government involvement), so all three passages (sponsorship record, final vote 57-0-3, bill text) are coded `adjacent`/`off-axis` and the row is `BLANK` (`no-evidence`).
